- Grid lines: stroke `rgba(130,170,255,.07)`.
- Maybe coordinate labels? no.

Walls:
```js
const x=pad+cx*cell, y=pad+cy*cell;
roundRect(ctx,x+cell*.06,y+cell*.06,cell*.88,cell*.88,cell*.18);
fill gradient #101832→#070b19; stroke rgba(120,150,255,.14); 
