```
- Add vertical light column when lit? A subtle vertical gradient line.
- lit crystals should emit small particles periodically (app can spawn? Renderer can draw static sparkles based on time).
- Draw a halo radial gradient.

Mirrors:
```js
const angle = animatedAngle(i); // from anim
ctx.save(); translate(cx,cy); rotate(angle*Math.PI/180);
// socket circle r=cell*0.22 fill dark, stroke
// diagonal line from -len to +len, len=cell*0.30
