```
- The mirror line should be a full diameter. At angle -45 or 45.
- Add glow shadow.
- Active/hover: ring.
- If hintIndex === i, draw pulsing dashed ring and a small `↻` arrow above. Maybe draw an arrow using path.

Emitter:
- cx,cy; draw outer ring with rotating dashes, core orb radial gradient, directional nozzle triangle pointing dir.
