Particles:
- Draw circles with `globalCompositeOperation='lighter'`; color; alpha = life/maxLife; size shrinks.
- Particles in board coords (x,y in pixels? Use cell coordinates?). App spawns at cell centers in grid units, renderer converts: `pad + x*cell`. Store `{gx,gy,vx,vy}` in cell units, update in app with dt seconds. Renderer maps.
